          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<p>All the various combinations of k1, p1 ribbing can add so much to your knitting. But adding tuck opens even more possibilities. </p>\n\n<p>Also known as <a href=\"/glossary/fisherman-rib\" class=\"glossary-link\">Fisherman Rib</a>, <a href=\"/glossary/half-fisherman-rib\" class=\"glossary-link\">Half Fisherman Rib</a> and <a href=\"/glossary/english-rib-half-fisherman-rib\" class=\"glossary-link\">English Rib | Half Fisherman Rib</a>, these techniques and all of their variations can produce amazing fabrics.</p>",
              "legacyComponentId": 6624,
              "order": 1,
